# Security

- Never read, log, or commit secrets, production URLs with credentials, or student data.
- Treat all user input as untrusted. Validate with Zod. Render chat as text, never HTML.
- Permissions are enforced on the server.
- Do not write exploit PoCs or attack procedures.
- Prefer failing tests and hardening patches.
- `.env` is local only. `.env.example` contains names and safe placeholders.
